<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>etl-rs — third-party licences</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    --bg: #ffffff; --fg: #1c1e21; --muted: #5c6470;
    --rule: #e3e6ea; --card: #f6f8fa; --link: #1667c4;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root { --bg: #1b1b1d; --fg: #e3e3e3; --muted: #9aa0a6;
            --rule: #33353a; --card: #242526; --link: #62a0ea; }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; padding: 2rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
    font: 16px/1.6 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }
  main { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .75rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  a { color: var(--link); }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 2rem; }
  .toc { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }
  .toc ul { margin: .5rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .crates { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem; margin: .75rem 0 1.25rem; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .crates li {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 5px;
    padding: .15rem .5rem; font-size: .85rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  }
  pre {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.5;
    white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;
  }
  code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p class="lede">
  Generated from <code>Cargo.lock</code> by
  <a href="https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about">cargo-about</a> — not hand-maintained.
  etl-rs itself is licensed under Apache-2.0; this page inventories the
  <strong>dependencies</strong> it links and reproduces the full text of each
  licence they are used under. Where a dependency offers a choice
  (<code>MIT OR Apache-2.0</code> and similar), the term shown is the one elected.
</p>
<p class="lede">
  This is the <strong>union across every optional feature</strong>. A default
  build links a strict subset; the extra crates come from opt-in features such as
  <code>kafka-tls</code>, <code>coordination-nats</code> and <code>json-simd</code>.
  Dev-dependencies are excluded — they are never distributed. etl-rs's own
  crates appear alongside the third-party ones, each under Apache-2.0. A compact,
  text-free inventory lives in <code>THIRD-PARTY.md</code> in the repository.
</p>

<div class="toc">
  <strong>Licences in this build</strong>
  <ul>
  {{#each overview}}
    <li>{{name}} <code>({{id}})</code> — {{count}} crate(s)</li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
</div>

<p class="lede">
  Each section below is one dependency's own copy of its licence. They are listed
  per crate rather than merged per licence because the copyright lines differ,
  and reproducing each crate's notice is exactly what MIT and Apache-2.0 section 4
  require.
</p>

{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="lic-{{@index}}">
  {{#each used_by}}<code>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</code>{{/each}}
  — {{name}} <code>({{id}})</code>
</h2>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
